cff-version: 1.2.0
title: pdfnative-mcp
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: Nizoka
    website: "https://github.com/Nizoka"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nizoka/pdfnative-mcp"
url: "https://github.com/Nizoka/pdfnative-mcp"
abstract: >-
  Model Context Protocol (MCP) server bridging the zero-dependency pdfnative
  library to AI clients. Provides 12 production-grade tools for PDF generation,
  PDF/A archival, embedded barcodes, digital signatures (PAdES with RSA/ECDSA),
  multi-script text, smart tables, interactive forms, embedded files (Factur-X),
  signature verification, and PDF introspection.
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2025-01-01"
keywords:
  - mcp
  - model-context-protocol
  - pdf
  - pdf-a
  - pades
  - digital-signature
  - factur-x
  - ai-tools
